|               | (4) array reshape           |   948        | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns         |   971        | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                             |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification     |   951        | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization         |   951        | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
